 the main architecture for running models, with multi-gigawatt deployments targeted from 2027. Maia 300 packs 96 chips per rack — double Maia 200 — and claims 7x token throughput per rack plus https://t.co/TrBnNnlxTj","url":"https://x.com/Tesla_Optimus_K/status/2109805124021600267"},{"author_id":"1262309365983383553","created_at":"2026-10-13T16:29:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110045380796874999"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/reliquary_ai/s…","end":184,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/reliquary_ai/status/2110037644239609876","start":161,"url":"https://t.co/AcW99nyCiR"}]},"id":"2110045380796874999","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":43,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"If you have a GPU doing nothing, read this.\n\nEvery idle GPU could be doing post-training.\n\nPost-training doesn’t need a datacenter. It needs GPUs that are free. https://t.co/AcW99nyCiR","url":"https://x.com/RomAI__/status/2110045380796874999"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109888199103250433"]},"author_id":"86772087","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:05:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109888209685487846"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/O38o4rLhvM","end":296,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/KrakowiakK/status/2109888209685487846/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109888199103250433","start":273,"url":"https://t.co/O38o4rLhvM"}]},"id":"2109888209685487846","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":294,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"AI in short 🍿 Tuesday\n\n- ∞ Meta Muse Wonder: agent models with Active Memory, gigawatt training\n- ✦ AlphaProof Nexus solves 9 of 353 open Erdős problems, 2 open 56 yrs\n- 🖼️ MiniCPM-V-4.7: 35B MoE, 3B active, Apache-2.0, runs on device 🇨🇳\n- 🤖 Reflex humanoid catches boxes: https://t.co/O38o4rLhvM","url":"https://x.com/KrakowiakK/status/2109888209685487846"},{"author_id":"1603077234939527170","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:00:47.0